### 退款接口使用的登录凭证
# @name refundLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"admin","password":"12345678"}

###

### 消费者对订单项申请退款（金额不得超过该实付小计；已有待处理退款返回 409）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-items/2/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{refundLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_cent": 5359,
  "reason": "拍错了，不想要了"
}

###

### 我的退款列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{refundLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

###

### 运营查看全部退款单（支持 status=pending|approved|rejected|refunded 过滤）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/refunds?page=1&page_size=10&status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{refundLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

###

### 运营审核通过并模拟退款成功（重复审核返回 404/409）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/refunds/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{refundLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

###

### 运营驳回退款申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/refunds/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{refundLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

###
